            <ArticleTitle>Compression of a subintimal or false lumen stent by stenting in the true lumen.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>698-701</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Subintimal or false lumen deployment is a rare complication of coronary stenting. The authors present a case of false lumen right coronary artery stenting with subsequent closure of the false lumen followed by stenting of the true lumen and compression of the false lumen stent.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
